A [[Book of Wishes]] provided by the [[Achievement Maniac]] would provide a list of in-game achievements, e.g. 

* Having a tuxemon at high level before it evolves 
* Fighting a water-tuxemon trainer with fire-tuxemon 
* Giving a dog tuxemon to a [[Cat Girl]].  

After the player achieved one of these goals, they could return to the Achievement Maniac for a prize ("memento").

